%% Mermaid architecture diagram for realtime-analytics-dashboard
flowchart LR
    subgraph Client
        A[Browser\nReact + Vite + TypeScript]
    end

    subgraph Backend
        B[FastAPI\nJWT Auth + REST]
        C[(Redis\nPub/Sub)]
        D[(PostgreSQL)]
        E[psutil Collector\n(1s polling)]
    end

    A <-->|WebSocket (JWT)| B
    A <-->|REST /metrics| B
    E -->|CPU/MEM/DISK/NET| B
    B -->|Publish latest| C
    C -->|Realtime updates| A
    B -->|1 min aggregates| D
    D -->|Historical data| A

    subgraph Tooling
        F[Docker Compose]
        G[GitHub Actions\nCI/CD]
        H[pre-commit Hooks]
    end

    F --> A
    F --> B
    G --> B
    G --> A
    H --> B
